    "## Step 6 - Run tasks via downstream agent\n",
    "\n",
    "Your query is sent to the agent via `agent.{method}(query)`. The agent uses the injected tools internally.

**Tip:** `seqmagick` is pip-installable and needs no Rust toolchain, so it runs out of the box in Colab — try a query like *"Use seqmagick to summarize reads.fasta and reverse-complement it to rc.fasta."* The `bqtools` BINSEQ tools also work, but require a Rust/`cargo` toolchain to be installed first (see the install note in the registry)."
   ]
